T1  - Comprehensive analysis of frameworks for evaluating artificial intelligence solutions in Healthcare: A descriptive review
AU  - Fajkis-Zajączkowska, Nikola
AU  - Zawada, Anna
AU  - Bojko, Magdalena
AU  - Kolasa, Katarzyna
JO  - Computers in Biology and Medicine
VL  - 196
