T1  - Large Language Model–Based Behavioral Activation Chatbot for Young People With Depression Using Artificial Users and Clinical Experts: Mixed Methods Evaluation
AU  - Kuhlmeier, Florian Onur
AU  - Hanschmann, Leon
AU  - Rabe, Melina
AU  - Lüttke, Stefan
AU  - Brakemeier, Eva-Lotta
