T1  - Implementation Readiness and Adoption of AI-Enabled Voice Electronic Medical Records in Resource-Constrained African Health Systems: Multisite Qualitative Study
AU  - Desalegn, Melika
AU  - Lee, Hocheol
AU  - Tilahun, Dawit Wondifraw
AU  - Sugi, Alemu
